    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KAISA commands you!</strong> Wishlist now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>After the sun sets and the clock strikes midnight, your task begins:</strong> you must feed your master before the first light of dawn. How hard can it possibly be to survive the night? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>What happens during the day?... Well, that's another story.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed your master during the night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scheme &amp; Prepare during the day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find or order mighty weapons like REGULAR chopsticks or UNIMPRESSIVE kitchen knifes to improve your combat abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who knew lies could be a currency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stuff your master to turn back time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beware the noise you make, for that which listens will come..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everything is as it seems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About us:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re a small, passionate two-man team that has been working hard for over 3 years to bring this game to life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magnus:</strong> Handles the visual and gameplay side of things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bj\u00f6rn:</strong> Makes it all run with code and\u2026 dark magic? <i>(Magnus\u2019s note.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Our Vision</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Kaisa: Resurrection</i> is ment to be a\u00a0<strong>brutal but rewarding</strong> experience. A game that\u2019s <strong>easy to pick up but demands real skill to master</strong>. It\u2019s <strong>challenging, bloody, and unforgiving</strong>, but every victory is earned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We love <strong>mystery and the unexpected</strong>, and weaving those elements into the game is a big part of our goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Quick Note</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Kaisa: Resurrection</i> is <strong>actively in development</strong>, and this is <strong>not a finished product</strong>. Features, balance, and mechanics <strong>will continue to evolve</strong>, and  changes may come and go based on player feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you <strong>encounter a bug</strong> or have feedback, we\u2019d love to hear from you! Drop by our <strong>Discord</strong> and let us know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
