\"><strong>Bj\u00f6rn:</strong> Makes it all run with code and\u2026 dark magic? <i>(Magnus\u2019s note.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Our Vision</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Kaisa: Resurrection</i> is ment to be a\u00a0<strong>brutal but rewarding</strong> experience. A game that\u2019s <strong>easy to pick up but demands real skill to master</strong>. It\u2019s <strong>challenging, bloody, and unforgiving</strong>, but every victory is earned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We love <strong>mystery and the unexpected</strong>, and weaving those elements into the game is a big part of our goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Quick Note</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Kaisa: Resurrection</i> is <strong>actively in development</strong>, and this is <strong>not a finished product</strong>. Features, balance, and mechanics <strong>will continue to evolve</strong>, and  changes may come and go based on player feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you <strong>encounter a bug</strong> or have feedback, we\u2019d love to hear from you! Drop by our <strong>Discord</strong> and let us know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
